sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 Financial Analyst
    participant UI as 💻 Browser (Web Client)
    participant Route as 🛡️ Flask Assistant Route
    participant Evidence as 🔍 Evidence Retrieval Service
    participant DB as 🗄️ MySQL Database
    participant LLM as 🧠 AI / LLM Engine

    User->>UI: Types financial inquiry (e.g., "Summarize Q3 operating margin")
    UI->>Route: POST /dashboard/assistant/chat (CSRF + Session Cookie)
    
    Route->>DB: Query user's processed documents & extraction data
    DB-->>Route: Return structured tables & text chunks
    
    Route->>Evidence: Retrieve relevant evidence snippets matching query
    Evidence-->>Route: Grounded citations (Page #, table cells, doc ID)
    
    Route->>LLM: Send prompt + System Guardrails + Verified Context
    LLM-->>Route: Generate answer grounded strictly in provided context
    
    Route->>DB: Save interaction in chat_histories (User prompt, AI answer, citations)
    DB-->>Route: Commit confirmed
    
    Route-->>UI: JSON { answer: "...", citations: [...] }
    UI->>User: Render response with clickable evidence source pills
